    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246970/extras/27d3d21c6ee97d97f80d0c6575b6d64c.avif?t=1747724340\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your ship to destroy incoming enemies to prevent them from damaging your ship or getting past you! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between levels upgrade your weapon systems using credits acquired from destroyed enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up temporary powerups dropped by slain enemies to enhance your blasting skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock levels and encounter new enemy types while progressing through the game.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246970/extras/2ef2d32a4c2399cc10e5dd0cfd5fce09.webp?t=1747724340\" width=16 height=16 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246970/extras/27d3d21c6ee97d97f80d0c6575b6d64c.avif?t=1747724340\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your ship to destroy incoming enemies to prevent them from damaging your ship or getting past you! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between levels upgrade your weapon systems using credits acquired from destroyed enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up temporary powerups dropped by slain enemies to enhance your blasting skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock levels and encounter new enemy types while progressing through the game.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246970/extras/2ef2d32a4c2399cc10e5dd0cfd5fce09.webp?t=1747724340\" width=16 height=16 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Blast your way through increasing waves of enemies in this fast-paced top-down action-arcade shoot 'em-up while unlocking new levels, weapon upgrades and harder enemy types as you make progress in RED BLASTER!",
